cmd-removeextracomponents-desc = Removes all components from all entities of the specified id if that component is not in its prototype.\nIf no id is specified, it matches all entities.
cmd-removeextracomponents-help = 移除額外元件 / 移除額外元件<entityId>
cmd-removeextracomponents-invalid-prototype-id = 找不到 ID 為 { $id } 的實體原型。
cmd-removeextracomponents-success = 從 { $entities } 中移除了 { $count } 元件，
cmd-removeextracomponents-success-with-id = 已從 ID 為 { $id } 的 { $entities } 中移除 { $count } 元件。
